linux-m8x (6.18.38-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * New upstream release.
  * Custom built Linux kernel for Amlogic Meson8 / Meson8m2 TV boxes.
  * Patches 001-098 are adapted from xdarklight's linux fork, branch
    "meson-mx-integration-6.20-20251223", split into one file per
    upstream commit (in their original order) for easier review and
    bisection. Some are marked WiP, HACK, TODO or DO NOT USE in their
    filename suffix.
  * Patches 099-103 are local fixes/additions on top of the
    xdarklight-derived series, adapting it to vanilla kernel 6.18.38
    (dwmac-meson build fix, stmmac MAC address from cmdline, mmc
    reboot fix, extra device trees, irq-meson-gpio wake fix).
  * Adds device trees for MINIX NEO X8-H, Tronsmart MXIII and M8S (dvfs).

 -- Antoni Aloy Torrens <aaloytorrens@gmail.com>  Sun, 19 Jul 2026 15:00:00 +0000
